{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n    <transition event=\"go.fast\" target=\"c\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n  <final id=\"c\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":2},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":95,"endColumn":5,"endLine":3,"startColumn":5,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"<transition event=\"go.fast\" target=\"c\"/>\n    "}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":45,"byteOffset":130,"endColumn":45,"endLine":4,"startColumn":40,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"move this transition before the earlier one"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}},{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":45,"byteOffset":130,"endColumn":45,"endLine":4,"startColumn":40,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the unreachable transition"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":31,"endLine":4,"startColumn":24,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"transition on `go.fast` in `a` can never be selected\n\n**Note:** within one state the interpreter selects the first enabled transition in document order; every event it matches is matched first by an earlier unconditional transition\n\n**Help:** move this transition above the earlier one if it should take priority, add a `cond` to the earlier transition, or remove this one\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions","text":"transition on `go.fast` in `a` can never be selected"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":161,"start":154},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"this earlier transition has no `cond` and always matches first"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":16,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML034"},{"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":7,"startColumn":14,"startLine":7}}}],"message":{"markdown":"final state `c` can never become active\n\n**Note:** reachability assumes every event can arrive and every `cond` can be true; no reachable transition, `initial`, or history default enters this state or any of its descendants\n\n**Help:** target `c` from a transition of a reachable state, make it the initial state of the <scxml> root, or remove it\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.11 Legal State Configurations and Specifications\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions","text":"final state `c` can never become active"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":219,"start":218},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"the <scxml> root enters `a` by default"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml034-shadowed-transition.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":72,"endLine":1,"startColumn":71,"startLine":1}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML029"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"no transition, `initial`, or history default reachable from the initial configuration enters the state or any descendant, even assuming every event arrives and every `cond` can be true; unreachable states are usually a mistyped target or a forgotten transition"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: target the state from a transition of a reachable state, make it the parent's initial state, or remove it.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.11 Legal State Configurations and Specifications\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML029` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#LegalStateConfigurations","id":"SCXML029","name":"SCXML029","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a state can never become active"}},{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"within one state the interpreter selects the first enabled transition in document order; an earlier transition without `cond` whose descriptors match every event of a later one (or an earlier eventless one) always wins, so the later transition is dead"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the specific transition above the general one, add a `cond` to the earlier transition, or remove the dead one.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.13 Selecting and Executing Transitions\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML034` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#SelectingTransitions","id":"SCXML034","name":"SCXML034","properties":{"category":"lint"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition is shadowed by an earlier unconditional transition in the same state"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}